<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia currency up 0.001 pct in week to Monday.</title>
<headline>Mongolia currency up 0.001 pct in week to Monday.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's tugrik strengthened 0.001 percent against the dollar by Monday compared with a week ago, central bank figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official rate of the tugrik was up to 798.03 against the dollar on Monday from 798.97 the previous Monday, the Bank of Mongolia said.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official rate based on the previous week's interbank trade.</p>
</text>
